=head2 SDL_PenAxis

Pen axis indices.

=over

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_PRESSURE = 0 - Pen pressure. Unidirectional: 0 to 1.0

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_XTILT = 1 - Pen horizontal tilt angle. Bidirectional: -90.0 to 90.0 (left-to-right).

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_YTILT = 2 - Pen vertical tilt angle. Bidirectional: -90.0 to 90.0 (top-to-down).

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_DISTANCE = 3 - Pen distance to drawing surface. Unidirectional: 0.0 to 1.0

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_ROTATION = 4 - Pen barrel rotation. Bidirectional: -180 to 179.9 (clockwise, 0 is facing up, -180.0 is facing down).

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_SLIDER = 5 - Pen finger wheel or slider (e.g., Airbrush Pen). Unidirectional: 0 to 1.0

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_TANGENTIAL_PRESSURE = 6 - Pressure from squeezing the pen ("barrel pressure").

=item SDL_PEN_AXIS_COUNT = 7 - Total known pen axis types in this version of SDL. This number may grow in future releases!

=back

=head2 SDL_PenDeviceType

An enum that describes the type of a pen device.

=over

=item SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_INVALID = -1 - Not a valid pen device.

=item SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_UNKNOWN = 0 - Don't know specifics of this pen.

=item SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_DIRECT = 1 - Pen touches display.

=item SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_INDIRECT = 2 - Pen touches something that isn't the display.

=back



